values ('fq_arc_002', 'Does the Crystal Dream', 'story', 'D', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'CRYSTAL_SLOPE', 'Crystal Sproutlings grow from Shard fragment deposits — they are, technically, living extensions of the same material that was shattered during the Great Severance. (Location: Crystal Slope, Scholar Elara) High Seeker Elara Voss believes they possess a rudimentary Aethelgardian-coded consciousness, a biological memory of the world before the Siphon overloaded. The Arcanum does not apologize for how it learns. Engage them. Collect what remains.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_scholar", "name": "High Seeker Elara Voss", "location": "CRYSTAL_SLOPE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 1, "reputation_required": 5, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_001"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRYSTAL_SPROUTLING", "count": 4, "description": "Neutralize Crystal Sproutlings for study."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_fragment", "count": 2, "description": "Collect crystal fragment (x2). [Item: Crystal Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 55, "currency": 35, "crd": 0, "rep": 35, "items": [{"item_id": "sprite_dust", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_003', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 1)
