values ('fq_arc_004', 'Ghosts of the Aethelgardians', 'story', 'D', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'CRYSTAL_SLOPE', 'An Aethelgardian text recovered from the Resonance Caverns — one of the Arcanum''s most prized possessions — describes the Crystal Wisps as ''light-formed messengers, carrying the speech of those who built the Siphon.'' High Seeker Elara Voss believes every Wisp that flickers out is a word from before the Severance, lost forever. (Location: Crystal Slope, Scholar Elara) She wants their energy signatures captured before that language is gone entirely. The methodology is unfortunate but necessary.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_scholar", "name": "High Seeker Elara Voss", "location": "CRYSTAL_SLOPE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 3, "reputation_required": 15, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_003"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRYSTAL_WISP", "count": 5, "description": "Contain Crystal Wisps for energy analysis."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_dust", "count": 1, "description": "Collect crystal dust (x1). [Item: Crystal Dust]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 80, "currency": 50, "crd": 0, "rep": 50, "items": [{"item_id": "con_nutrient_ration", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_005', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 3)
