values ('fq_arc_007', 'How the Glass Learns to Walk', 'story', 'D', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY', 'Glass Crawlers evolved in the Fractured Glass Valley over generations, developing reinforced chitin that lets them move through razor-edged terrain that cuts through standard armor plating in minutes. Archivist Sylas believes their locomotion pattern is derived from Aethelgardian nano-structure principles — essentially, the creatures stumbled into a solution the ancient engineers spent centuries developing. Their movement data could redefine Arcanum field equipment design. Collect specimens carefully.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_archivist", "name": "Archivist Sylas", "location": "FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 6, "reputation_required": 25, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_006"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GLASS_CRAWLER", "count": 5, "description": "Neutralize Glass Crawlers and record movement patterns."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "desert_chitin", "count": 3, "description": "Collect desert chitin (x3). [Item: Desert Chitin]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 120, "currency": 70, "crd": 0, "rep": 70, "items": [{"item_id": "rust_chitin", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_008', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 6)
