values ('fq_arc_008', 'The Rat in the Archive', 'story', 'D', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY', 'A Giant Alpha Rat has made the valley''s sealed archive chamber its nest — the chamber that Arcanum scouts confirmed contains pre-Severance data cylinders still intact after centuries. (Location: Fractured Glass Valley, Scholar Elara) High Seeker Elara Voss''s voice is tight when she explains this. The Concordium had this chamber on their survey maps for decades and left it sealed. The Arcanum broke through last season. A rat will not reclaim what human curiosity has finally unlocked.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_scholar", "name": "High Seeker Elara Voss", "location": "FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 7, "reputation_required": 30, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_007"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIANT_ALPHA_RAT", "count": 1, "description": "Defeat the Giant Alpha Rat in the archive chamber."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "alpha_fang", "count": 3, "description": "Collect alpha fang (x3). [Item: Alpha Fang]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 180, "currency": 100, "crd": 0, "rep": 100, "items": [{"item_id": "ancient_scale", "quantity": 1}, {"item_id": "con_small_hp_cell", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_009', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 7)
