values ('fq_arc_009', 'Complexity in the Shards', 'story', 'D', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY', 'Glass Wisps are what Crystal Wisps become after generations of exposure to the valley''s compressed aethel radiation — their energy signatures have grown so complex that Researcher Vin''s field equipment can barely parse them. (Location: Fractured Glass Valley, Researcher Vin) This is exactly why the Arcanum exists. Every other faction on Xylos sees these creatures as obstacles. The Arcanum sees them as data points in the longest experiment in history: what does the Severance eventually become?', '{"npc_id": "npc_researcher_vin", "name": "Researcher Vin", "location": "FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 8, "reputation_required": 35, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_008"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GLASS_WISP", "count": 5, "description": "Contain Glass Wisp energy signatures."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "glass_shard", "count": 2, "description": "Collect glass shard (x2). [Item: Glass Shard]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 200, "currency": 110, "crd": 0, "rep": 110, "items": [{"item_id": "dark_energy_fragment", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_010', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 8)
