values ('fq_arc_010', 'Horns of the Old Current', 'story', 'D', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY', 'Crystal Rams grow their horns by absorbing the deep aethel currents that flow through the valley''s crystalline substrate — the same currents that once powered Aethelgardian technology. (Location: Fractured Glass Valley, Scholar Elara) Their horns are essentially biological aethel conduits, grown over decades into shapes that mirror the original Siphon''s internal architecture. High Seeker Elara Voss wants two of them for a reconstruction project she has never shared with the Concordium and never will.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_scholar", "name": "High Seeker Elara Voss", "location": "FRACTURED_GLASS_VALLEY"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 9, "reputation_required": 40, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_009"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRYSTAL_RAM", "count": 2, "description": "Defeat Crystal Rams in the deep ravine."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_horn", "count": 2, "description": "Collect crystal horn (x2). [Item: Crystal Horn]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 300, "currency": 180, "crd": 0, "rep": 180, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "con_medium_hp_cell", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_011', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 9)
