values ('fq_arc_011', 'The Caverns That Speak', 'story', 'C', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'RESONANCE_CAVERNS', 'The Resonance Caverns were discovered by an Arcanum expedition three years ago — and immediately classified by the Concordium, who found the frequency emissions ''destabilizing to infrastructure.'' What that really means, High Seeker Elara Voss explains, is that the Concordium is afraid of what the caverns are saying. The frequencies match Aethelgardian communication protocols last recorded three hundred years before the Severance. The Arcanum is listening now. Quest giver: Scholar Elara at Observatory Spire Research Wing.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_scholar", "name": "High Seeker Elara Voss", "location": "RESONANCE_CAVERNS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 10, "reputation_required": 45, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_010"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "RESONANCE_CAVERNS", "count": 1, "description": "Enter the Resonance Caverns."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "rat_hide", "count": 2, "description": "Collect rat hide (x2). [Item: Rat Hide]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 280, "currency": 150, "crd": 0, "rep": 150, "items": [{"item_id": "psionic_resonator", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_012', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 10)
