values ('fq_arc_060', 'The Harbinger''s Secret', 'boss', 'S', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'THE ULTIMATE KNOWLEDGE TRIAL. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, Scholar Elara) The Abyss Harbinger is a dimensional library — a living archive of forbidden knowledge. Defeat the Raid Boss Tier-2 entity and claim every secret it holds. Knowledge is Power. Secrets are Sovereignty.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_scholar", "name": "Scholar Elara", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 59, "reputation_required": 3480, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_059"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "ABYSS_HARBINGER", "count": 1, "description": "DEFEAT THE ABYSS HARBINGER. [Abyss Harbinger]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "abyss_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect abyss fragment (x1). [Item: Abyss Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 15000, "currency": 7500, "crd": 3750, "rep": 5000, "items": [{"item_id": "void_core", "quantity": 5}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "con_elite_recovery_pack", "quantity": 10}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_061', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 59)
