values ('fq_arc_070', 'The Titan''s Core', 'boss', 'S', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'THE GRAVITATIONAL TRIAL. (Location: Cradle Expanse, Scholar Elara) The Gravity Titan has risen. Its core is the most valuable scientific specimen in Xylos history. The Arcanum demands you retrieve it — intact. Defeat the Raid Boss Tier-3 entity and claim the Titan''s gravitational heart for the eternal archives.', '{"npc_id": "npc_arcanum_scholar", "name": "Scholar Elara", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 69, "reputation_required": 4080, "required_quests": ["fq_arc_069"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRAVITY_TITAN", "count": 1, "description": "DEFEAT THE GRAVITY TITAN. [Gravity Titan]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "description": "Clear the Titan''s Abyssal escorts. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 20000, "currency": 10000, "crd": 5000, "rep": 7000, "items": [{"item_id": "titan_core", "quantity": 3}, {"item_id": "gravity_well_core", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_arc_071', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_arcanum.json', 69)
