values ('fq_conc_001', 'Blood in the Gardens', 'story', 'D', 'CONCORDIUM', 'AETHEL_GARDENS', 'The Aethel Gardens were once Xylos''s crown jewel — terraced bioluminescent groves fed by the Cradle''s overflow. Now they fester with Forest Slimes, born from the Severance''s corruption soaking into the soil. Commander Lirien Vale needs these supply routes clear before another convoy is lost to the ooze. This is your first step toward understanding what the Concordium is trying to rebuild. Quest giver: Officer Valen at Nexus Core Command Post.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "AETHEL_GARDENS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 1, "reputation_required": 0, "required_quests": []}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "FOREST_SLIME", "count": 5, "description": "Defeat Forest Slime lurking near supply routes."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "slime_gel", "count": 1, "description": "Collect slime gel (x1). [Item: Slime Gel]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 50, "currency": 30, "crd": 0, "rep": 30, "items": [{"item_id": "con_small_hp_cell", "quantity": 3}, {"item_id": "con_small_mp_cell", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_002', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 0)
