values ('fq_conc_002', 'Critters at the Gate', 'story', 'D', 'CONCORDIUM', 'AETHEL_GARDENS', 'The Concordium''s forward outpost in the Gardens is surrounded on three sides by Aethel Sproutlings — corrupted seedlings that haven''t known sunlight in decades. (Location: Aethel Gardens, Officer Valen) Commander Vale is stretched thin after the Schism fractured half her garrison to the Iron Hegemony defectors. The perimeter must hold; the Gardens are the only uncontested supply corridor into Nexus Core.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "AETHEL_GARDENS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 1, "reputation_required": 5, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_001"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_GARDEN_CRITTER", "count": 4, "description": "Defeat Garden Critters along the perimeter. [Aethel Garden Critter]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "minor_essence", "count": 1, "description": "Collect minor essence (x1). [Item: Minor Essence]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 55, "currency": 35, "crd": 0, "rep": 35, "items": [{"item_id": "con_small_hp_cell", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_003', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 1)
