values ('fq_conc_003', 'The Mite and the Depot', 'story', 'D', 'CONCORDIUM', 'AETHEL_GARDENS', 'Garden Mites feed on the bio-conductive wiring that channels aethel energy from the Gardens to Nexus Core — the same wiring the Concordium spent fifteen years laying after the Schism. (Location: Aethel Gardens, Officer Valen) If the eastern grove falls to this infestation, it won''t be slimes that broke the Concordium''s dream. It''ll be insects. Commander Vale needs this stopped before she has to write that report.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "AETHEL_GARDENS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 2, "reputation_required": 10, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_002"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GARDEN_MITE", "count": 6, "description": "Defeat Garden Mites in the eastern grove."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "mite_chitin", "count": 3, "description": "Collect mite chitin (x3). [Item: Mite Chitin]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 70, "currency": 40, "crd": 0, "rep": 40, "items": [{"item_id": "con_repair_patch", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_004', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 2)
