values ('fq_conc_012', 'Wolves at the Cradle', 'story', 'C', 'CONCORDIUM', 'CRADLE_OUTER_RING', 'Cradle Anomaly Wolves — creatures warped by proximity to the flux rifts surrounding the Aethel Cradle — are drawn to the Outer Ring''s energy surges. (Location: Cradle Outer Ring, Officer Valen) Their howls disrupt the harmonic resonators the Concordium uses to calibrate the Cradle''s output. Without stable calibration, the whole system risks cascade failure. The Concordium nearly lost the Cradle once. Commander Vale refuses to let it happen on her watch.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "CRADLE_OUTER_RING"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 11, "reputation_required": 50, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_011"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRADLE_ANOMALY_WOLF", "count": 5, "description": "Defeat Cradle Anomaly Wolves. [Cradle Anomaly Wolf]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "wild_hide", "count": 3, "description": "Collect wild hide (x3). [Item: Wild Hide]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 320, "currency": 170, "crd": 0, "rep": 170, "items": [{"item_id": "dark_energy_fragment", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_013', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 11)
