values ('fq_conc_013', 'Breeding in the Shadow of the Cradle', 'story', 'C', 'CONCORDIUM', 'CRADLE_OUTER_RING', 'Cradle Anomaly Beastlings are what happens when aethel radiation meets the Severance''s corrupted biosphere — creatures that should not exist, multiplying faster than the Concordium''s census teams can count. (Location: Cradle Outer Ring, Officer Valen) They''ve begun nesting in the maintenance shafts of the Outer Ring''s stabilizer array. If the array goes offline, the Arcanum Seekers will be on the doorstep before the dust settles.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "CRADLE_OUTER_RING"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 12, "reputation_required": 55, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_012"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRADLE_ANOMALY_BEASTLING", "count": 6, "description": "Defeat Cradle Anomaly Beastlings."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "void_fragment", "count": 4, "description": "Collect void fragment (x4). [Item: Void Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 360, "currency": 190, "crd": 0, "rep": 200, "items": [{"item_id": "animal_fang", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_014', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 12)
