values ('fq_conc_014', 'Cores on the Verge', 'story', 'C', 'CONCORDIUM', 'CRADLE_OUTER_RING', 'Cradle Fragment Beasts carry unstable aethel cores inside their bodies — shards of the original Shard, still radiating energy, embedded in living hosts. (Location: Cradle Outer Ring, Officer Valen) The Arcanum Seekers would want them captured; the Children of the Shard would want them worshipped. The Concordium wants them contained before they detonate and damage the Outer Ring''s flux regulators. Ideology is secondary to operational integrity.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "CRADLE_OUTER_RING"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 13, "reputation_required": 60, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_013"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRADLE_FRAGMENT_BEAST", "count": 5, "description": "Defeat Cradle Fragment Beasts."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "aethel_fragment", "count": 3, "description": "Collect aethel fragment (x3). [Item: Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 400, "currency": 210, "crd": 0, "rep": 220, "items": [{"item_id": "core_fragment", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_015', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 13)
