values ('fq_conc_016', 'The Price of the Ring', 'story', 'C', 'CONCORDIUM', 'CRADLE_OUTER_RING', 'Three Concordium scouts went dark in the Outer Ring''s eastern sector. (Location: Cradle Outer Ring, Officer Valen) Commander Vale reports this the way soldiers report casualties — precisely, without emotion, until the mission debrief when she says their names. The data they were carrying could reveal Iron Hegemony troop movements near the Cradle''s loading docks. Recover it. And if you find the scouts, record what you find.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "CRADLE_OUTER_RING"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 15, "reputation_required": 70, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_015"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "collect", "target": "void_fragment", "count": 3, "description": "Collect void fragment (x3). [Item: Void Fragment]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "CRADLE_ANOMALY_WOLF", "count": 4, "description": "Defeat any hostiles guarding the scout sites. [Cradle Anomaly Wolf]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 430, "currency": 230, "crd": 0, "rep": 230, "items": [{"item_id": "memory_fragment_chip", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_017', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 15)
