values ('fq_conc_017', 'A Crack in the Foundation', 'story', 'C', 'CONCORDIUM', 'CRADLE_OUTER_RING', 'A void breach has opened in the Outer Ring''s north platform — a point where the boundary between normal space and whatever dark geometry feeds the Void Channelers has grown thin. (Location: Cradle Outer Ring, Officer Valen) The Fragment Beasts that pour through it are getting stronger with each surge. Concordium engineers believe the breach appeared the same week the Iron Hegemony began unauthorized excavation near the Cradle''s base. That may be coincidence. It may not.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "Commander Lirien Vale", "location": "CRADLE_OUTER_RING"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 16, "reputation_required": 75, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_016"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRADLE_FRAGMENT_BEAST", "count": 6, "description": "Destroy Fragment Beasts near the breach. [Cradle Fragment Beast]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "aethel_fragment", "count": 2, "description": "Collect aethel fragment (x2). [Item: Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 480, "currency": 260, "crd": 0, "rep": 260, "items": [{"item_id": "void_fragment", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_018', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 16)
